[id: 14088, name: "මිනිහා minihaa person", weight: 0.02, group: sinhala_common]
මිනිහා -> minihaː;

[id: 14089, name: "ළමයා lamayaa child", weight: 0.02, group: sinhala_common]
ළමයා -> lʌmʌjaː;

